"The Guardian persona copies the mind and Concept of a well-studied specimen."
"It fights under a Tier-1 limiter until a contract clause lets it release it."
"It sits wired into a seat inside the colossal face, which swings open like a hinged mask."
"It can rebuild its body to copy an enemy's style, even turning its staff into a flaming axe."
"It sheds heat through radiator fins on its shoulders and walls itself with force."
"It claims it has not enjoyed a battle in centuries."
"Its severed hand becomes a prize piece of tier-2 construct for Aurora's researchers."
